  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID 19 RESPONSE TO ADDRESS NUTRITION/WASH NEEDS OF CHILDREN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This support to UNICEF Cambodia aims to address acute nutrition and sanitation issues faced by children and their families most affected by crises including COVID-19, through: promotion and support to optimal feeding practices and early detection and treatment for children with SAM; and provision of essential hand hygiene supplies to poor and vulnerable households at risk and provision of climate adapted sanitation facilities in underserved and flood prone areas.</narrative>
  </description>
